Mines aren't difficult at all. You just sit there on Elbereth waiting
for your pet to clear the area near the upstairs (well, not just sit-
if you feel that it's safe, you can explore-Elbereth-wait a little
more). If you previously heard chugging sounds or crashing rock, you
go for the pickaxe. You dig a little box in the border of the map. You
let your pet trapped there, something like:
  -
--f--
.-@-.

You dig down. Repeat on the next level, till Minetown. The only level
that's a bit unsafe it's the first one. And maybe the second one, in
the rare occasion that there's no pickaxe in the first one.

