I never see a wand before minetown. If I go back to Sokoban, then I'm
almost definitely breaking the PR. Although I've completed Sokoban at
XP1 several times. More often than not it involves a warhorse or a
couple of dogs to deal with the giant mimics, plus something to deal
with floating eyes in the main dungeon. If you can't deal with
floating eyes (/make invisible, !blindness, /teleportation,...) going
past dlvl4 is a big no no.

